("Taproot Assets", "Bitcoin", "A protocol for issuing stablecoins and other real-world assets on Bitcoin while settling through Lightning.", 3, ""),
("Bitcoin Dominance", "Metrics", "Bitcoin's share of the total crypto market value. When it rises, money is usually rotating out of altcoins into BTC.", 2, ""),
("Maximalist", "Culture", "A Bitcoin-only believer who argues every other crypto asset is unnecessary or a scam. Loud, numerous and frequently right about altcoin cycles.", 2, ""),
("Stock-to-Flow", "Metrics", "A popular (and widely criticised) Bitcoin model that treats scarcity like gold, comparing existing supply to new issuance.", 3, ""),
("Cold Storage", "Security", "Keeping private keys completely offline on a hardware device or paper, so no hacker, exchange or malware can reach them.", 1, ""),

# ---------------- ETHEREUM & SMART CONTRACTS ----------------
